@startuml gaps
!include style.iuml
title TrendDetective (data-expansion @ 524818c) — Feature gaps between the work areas
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam nodesep 30
skinparam ranksep 90
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.3
skinparam ArrowFontSize 13
skinparam ArrowFontStyle bold
skinparam ArrowColor #b03a2e
skinparam ArrowFontColor #b03a2e

package "① MAP WIDGET" as P1 #e3eefc;line:2f6fb3;line.bold {
  component "**Region selection**\n22 predefined bboxes\nno antimeridian bbox" as A1 #ffffff;line:2f6fb3
  component "**DataRenderer**\ngeojson · raster · image\nfeature colours, popups" as A2 #ffffff;line:2f6fb3
  component "**MapController**\nclearArea without onAreaCleared\nno setTool" as A3 #ffffff;line:2f6fb3
}

package "② USER INTERFACE & WEB SERVER" as P2 #e2f3e6;line:2e8b57;line.bold {
  component "**Topic list**\nraw keys of all 6 providers" as B1 #ffffff;line:2e8b57
  component "**Apply without area**\nallowed" as B2 #ffffff;line:2e8b57
  component "**Free date range**\nany length" as B3 #ffffff;line:2e8b57
  component "**Result cards**\nno sources / duplicates\nno LR significance (point)" as B4 #ffffff;line:2e8b57
  component "**Error handling**\nsend_error HTML · RuntimeError\nuncaught · generic message" as B5 #ffffff;line:2e8b57
  component "**Tools on Apply**\nall true, no picker" as B6 #ffffff;line:2e8b57
}

package "③ DATA & CALCULATIONS" as P3 #fdeedd;line:c46a12;line.bold {
  component "**_extract_coordinates**\nno area → Washington DC" as C1 #ffffff;line:c46a12
  component "**Point-flow tools**\nLR.process: no p / CI\nx = 0..n-1 (gaps squeezed)" as C2 #ffffff;line:c46a12
  component "**Point map_layers**\n1 feature per key, same geometry\ncolour = slope sign" as C3 #ffffff;line:c46a12
  component "**Region results**\nsources · duplicates\nsource_errors" as C4 #ffffff;line:c46a12
  component "**area_analysis**\nuses _PROVIDERS, _get_json,\n_normalize_observations" as C5 #ffffff;line:c46a12
  component "**REGIONS**\n4 new regions with 0 / 0 counts" as C6 #ffffff;line:c46a12
}

package "④ API WRAPPER & SOURCES" as P4 #eee6fb;line:7048b8;line.bold {
  component "**Topics of 6 providers**\nno availability per place\nmarine: no station search" as D1 #ffffff;line:7048b8
  component "**NOAA point download**\nwhole range in one request\n(marine: month chunks)" as D2 #ffffff;line:7048b8
  component "**NOAATopic label + description**\nnot exposed" as D3 #ffffff;line:7048b8
  component "**★ station_coverage**\nNOAA TOPICS only" as D4 #ffffff;line:7048b8
  component "**PointDataProvider**\ncovers / covers_box\nnot in the Protocol" as D5 #ffffff;line:7048b8
  component "**★ nearest-station fetch**\nall providers in parallel" as D6 #ffffff;line:7048b8
}

D1 ..> B1 : **G2**
B3 ..> D2 : **G4**
B2 ..> C1 : **G6**
C2 ..> B4 : **G8**
C3 ..> A2 : **G10**
D3 ..> B1 : **G12**
B5 ..> D6 : **G13**
C4 ..> B4 : **G15**
D4 ..> B4 : **G16**
B6 ..> C2 : **G17**
C5 ..> D5 : **G18**
C6 ..> A1 : **G19**
A3 ..> B2 : **G20**

P1 -[hidden]right- P2
P1 -[hidden]down- P3
P2 -[hidden]down- P4
P3 -[hidden]right- P4

legend bottom
  |= Gap |= Status |= What happens today |= Who fixes it |
  | G1 | <color:#2e8b57>fixed</color> | Areas are now predefined regions evaluated with all stations inside (area_analysis); drawn shapes were removed. | – |
  | G2 | <color:#c46a12>partly</color> | All topics of all providers are offered everywhere; marine and many hourly topics still fail at most places. ★ The coverage box explains afterwards which years have data. | ④ availability check, ② disable |
  | G3 | <color:#2e8b57>fixed</color> | _parse_observation_period handles YYYY-MM-DD, YYYY-MM and YYYY. | – |
  | G4 | <color:#c46a12>partly</color> | Marine fetches are split by month, DWD / FMI / PolarWatch are chunked, but NOAA daily and hourly point requests still download the whole range at once. | ④ paging / cache, ② limit |
  | G5 | <color:#2e8b57>fixed</color> | split_by_variable gives one card per NOAA code (TMAX, TMIN, …). | – |
  | G6 | <color:#b03a2e>open</color> | Apply is enabled without a point or region; the point flow then silently uses Washington DC. | ② require area or ③ error |
  | G7 | <color:#2e8b57>fixed</color> | Cards show Mann-Kendall (trend, p, tau, z, S) and unavailable t-Tests. | – |
  | G8 | <color:#c46a12>partly</color> | analyze_trend (p, CI, r²) is used for regions and /api/analyze, but the point flow still uses LinearRegression.process on positions 0..n-1, so no significance and gaps compress the time axis. | ③ |
  | G9 | <color:#2e8b57>fixed</color> | Chart has date ticks and the unit on the y-axis. | – |
  | G10 | <color:#c46a12>partly</color> | Regions draw coloured station dots per key, but point results still stack one feature per key on the same geometry; without LR every feature is blue. | ③ ① legend / toggle |
  | G11 | <color:#2e8b57>moot</color> | Drawn areas are gone; points are wrapped. Remaining region case is G19. | – |
  | G12 | <color:#c46a12>partly</color> | Codes get readable labels (variable_label), but the topic list still shows keys like "wet_bulb_temperature". | ④ ② |
  | G13 | <color:#b03a2e>open</color> | /api/buttons replies with send_error (HTML) and does not catch RuntimeError / SourceError; the page shows a generic message. | ② |
  | G14 | <color:#2e8b57>fixed</color> | ★ 6 providers registered; the point flow asks all that cover the place and keeps the nearest station. | – |
  | G15 | <color:#b03a2e>new</color> | ★ Region results carry sources, duplicates_removed, duplicates and source_errors; the cards show none of them (only the map popup shows a station's source). | ② |
  | G16 | <color:#b03a2e>new</color> | ★ /api/coverage only knows NOAA TOPICS, so empty cards from DWD / ECCC / FMI / ERA5 / PolarWatch get a 400. | ④ |
  | G17 | <color:#b03a2e>new</color> | No tool picker in the sidebar; Apply always sends every tool as true. Per-tool choice exists only in the plot panel. | ② |
  | G18 | <color:#b03a2e>new</color> | area_analysis reaches into private ④ APIs (_PROVIDERS, NOAAClient._get_json, _normalize_observations); covers / covers_box are looked up with getattr. | ④ public area API |
  | G19 | <color:#b03a2e>new</color> | ★ Toronto, Montreal, Vancouver, Helsinki have 0 / 0 station counts; a region bbox with west > east would not be drawn or evaluated correctly. | ③ ① |
  | G20 | <color:#b03a2e>new</color> | clearArea() does not fire onAreaCleared, so the page's selectedArea can go stale; setTool is not exposed (needed with hideToolbar). | ① |
  | Tests | <color:#b03a2e>note</color> | ★ src/test_task.py still patches fetch_data_single_topic_single_coordinate with provider "noaa"; the multi-provider path is untested. | ③ ④ |
endlegend
caption Arrows point from the area that offers a feature to the area that cannot use or deliver it. ★ = new on branch data-expansion, not yet on main.
@enduml
